  "notes": "Chart icon shows 360° operation with 5th (front) jack down. Notes p.12: rated loads include hook block and slings (25 t hook block 297 kg, 3 t hook 60 kg) and are within 75% of tipping load. Axle positions measured from carrier front bumper: front overhang E=2442 mm, wheelbase 4425+1350 mm, rear overhang 2420 mm (carrier 10637 mm); overall length 12535 mm includes 1528 mm boom/jib front extension and 370 mm rear. Transport height 3420 mm and length are for swing-away jib version (underslung jib: 12942 mm x 3920 mm). Total vehicle mass in travel configuration 27.5 t (axles 5.9/10.8/10.8 t). Max hook height 34.5 m is fully-extended boom hoist height (43.2 m with 8.3 m jib). Max load moment 965 kN·m base boom / 623 kN·m full boom. Wheel diameter, slew centre and boom pivot not dimensioned on drawing."
